    },
    {
      "s": "",
      "t": "A",
      "n": "RevealPrompt6"
    },
    {
      "s": "Des trucs chauds. ",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "805063_1",
      "n": "RevealJoke2"
    },
    {
      "s": "La saucière de grand-mère a disparu ! Rapide! Dans quoi devrions-nous mettre toute cette sauce ?! ",
      "t": "A",
      "n": "RevealPrompt5"
    },
    {
      "s": "Voici le scoop. ",
